Transcription
hi, ri	step forward
he, re	turn 90 degrees (moving front foot)
hen, ren	turn 90 degrees (moving back foot)
ha, ra	turn 180 degrees (stepping)
han, ran	turn 180 degrees (stationary)
ho, ro	turn 270 degrees (moving front foot)
hon, ron	turn 270 degrees (moving back foot)
hu, ru	step back
si, zi	front stance
se, ze	walking stance
sa, za	horseriding stance
so, zo	back stance
su, zu	tiger stance, cat stance
sye, zye	side stance
sya, zya	ready stance
syo, zyo	cross stance, X stance
syu, zyu	crane stance (front leg up)
sai, zai	diamond stance, angled forward stance
sau, zau	attention stance
saun, zaun	pushing fist stance (up and forward)
pi, bi	high block
pe, be	(middle) outside block
pen, ben	outside double block
pel, bel	outside block with both arms
pa, ba	low block
pan, ban	low double block
po, bo	middle block (inside)
pun, bun	middle cross block
pul, bul	low cross block
pye, bye	mountain high block
fi, vi	high knifehand block
fe, ve	middle knifehand (outside) block
fen, ven	middle double knifehand block
fa, va	low knifehand block
fan, van	low double knifehand block
fo, vo	(middle) palm heel (inside) block
fol, vol	palm heel block over other fist
ki, gi	front kick
ke, ge	roundhouse kick
ka, ga	side kick
kon, gon	crescent kick into other palm
ku, gu	knee strike
ti, di	high punch (to face)
te, de	uppercut
ten, den	double upset (uppercut to ribs)
ta, da	middle punch
to, do	backfist
tu, du	elbow strike
tun, dun	elbow strike into other palm
tul, dul	elbow strike with fist in other palm
tye, dye	knifehand strike (inward to neck)
tya, dya	spearhand thrust
tyu, dyu	grab and pull
tyun, dyun	grab and pull with both hands
tai, dai	hammer fist
h (after a vowel)	slow motion
q	yell

Taegeuk Il-Jang
What number is “il”?	1
Taegeuk Il-Jang (simplified)	Pa da, *mirror*.  Pa-da.  Po da, *mirror*.  Ba-ta.  Pi gi-da, *mirror*.  Pa daq!
___  Pa-da.  Po da, *mirror*.  Ba-ta.  Pi gi-da, *mirror*.  Pa daq!	Pa da, *mirror*.
Pa da, *mirror*.  ___  Po da, *mirror*.  Ba-ta.  Pi gi-da, *mirror*.  Pa daq!	Pa-da.
Pa da, *mirror*.  Pa-da.  ___  Ba-ta.  Pi gi-da, *mirror*.  Pa daq!	Po da, *mirror*.
Pa da, *mirror*.  Pa-da.  Po da, *mirror*.  ___  Pi gi-da, *mirror*.  Pa daq!	Ba-ta.
Pa da, *mirror*.  Pa-da.  Po da, *mirror*.  Ba-ta.  ___  Pa daq!	Pi gi-da, *mirror*.
Pa da, *mirror*.  Pa-da.  Po da, *mirror*.  Ba-ta.  Pi gi-da, *mirror*.  ___	Pa daq!

Taegeuk I-Jang
What number is “i”?	2
Taegeuk I-Jang (simplified)	Pa da, *mirror*.  Bo po.  Pa gi-di, *mirror*.  Pi bi.  Bo, *mirror*.  Pa gi-da ki-ta gi-daq!
___  Bo po.  Pa gi-di, *mirror*.  Pi bi.  Bo, *mirror*.  Pa gi-da ki-ta gi-daq!	Pa da, *mirror*.
Pa da, *mirror*.  ___  Pa gi-di, *mirror*.  Pi bi.  Bo, *mirror*.  Pa gi-da ki-ta gi-daq!	Bo po.
Pa da, *mirror*.  Bo po.  ___  Pi bi.  Bo, *mirror*.  Pa gi-da ki-ta gi-daq!	Pa gi-di, *mirror*.
Pa da, *mirror*.  Bo po.  Pa gi-di, *mirror*.  ___  Bo, *mirror*.  Pa gi-da ki-ta gi-daq!	Pi bi.
Pa da, *mirror*.  Bo po.  Pa gi-di, *mirror*.  Pi bi.  ___  Pa gi-da ki-ta gi-daq!	Bo, *mirror*.
Pa da, *mirror*.  Bo po.  Pa gi-di, *mirror*.  Pi bi.  Bo, *mirror*.  ___	Pa gi-da ki-ta gi-daq!

Taegeuk Sam-Jang
What number is “sam”?	3
Taegeuk Sam-Jang (simplified)	Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.  Dye tye.  Fe tyuda, *mirror*.  Bo po.  Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.  Pa-da ba-ta ki-pa-da gi-ba-taq!
___  Dye tye.  Fe tyuda, *mirror*.  Bo po.  Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.  Pa-da ba-ta ki-pa-da gi-ba-taq!	Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.
Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.  ___  Fe tyuda, *mirror*.  Bo po.  Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.  Pa-da ba-ta ki-pa-da gi-ba-taq!	Dye tye.
Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.  Dye tye.  ___  Bo po.  Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.  Pa-da ba-ta ki-pa-da gi-ba-taq!	Fe tyuda, *mirror*.
Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.  Dye tye.  Fe tyuda, *mirror*.  ___  Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.  Pa-da ba-ta ki-pa-da gi-ba-taq!	Bo po.
Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.  Dye tye.  Fe tyuda, *mirror*.  Bo po.  ___  Pa-da ba-ta ki-pa-da gi-ba-taq!	Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.
Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.  Dye tye.  Fe tyuda, *mirror*.  Bo po.  Pa gi-da-ta, *mirror*.  ___	Pa-da ba-ta ki-pa-da gi-ba-taq!

Taegeuk Sa-Jang
What number is “sa”?	4
Taegeuk Sa-Jang (simplified)	Fen fodya, *mirror*.  Fidye gi-ta ka-ga-ven.  Pe gi-bo, *mirror*.  Fidye gi-do.  Po-da, *mirror*.  Po-da-ta bo-ta-daq!
___  Fidye gi-ta ka-ga-ven.  Pe gi-bo, *mirror*.  Fidye gi-do.  Po-da, *mirror*.  Po-da-ta bo-ta-daq!	Fen fodya, *mirror*.
Fen fodya, *mirror*.  ___  Pe gi-bo, *mirror*.  Fidye gi-do.  Po-da, *mirror*.  Po-da-ta bo-ta-daq!	Fidye gi-ta ka-ga-ven.
Fen fodya, *mirror*.  Fidye gi-ta ka-ga-ven.  ___  Fidye gi-do.  Po-da, *mirror*.  Po-da-ta bo-ta-daq!	Pe gi-bo, *mirror*.
Fen fodya, *mirror*.  Fidye gi-ta ka-ga-ven.  Pe gi-bo, *mirror*.  ___  Po-da, *mirror*.  Po-da-ta bo-ta-daq!	Fidye gi-do.
Fen fodya, *mirror*.  Fidye gi-ta ka-ga-ven.  Pe gi-bo, *mirror*.  Fidye gi-do.  ___  Po-da-ta bo-ta-daq!	Po-da, *mirror*.
Fen fodya, *mirror*.  Fidye gi-ta ka-ga-ven.  Pe gi-bo, *mirror*.  Fidye gi-do.  Po-da, *mirror*.  ___	Po-da-ta bo-ta-daq!

Taegeuk O-Jang
What number is “o”?	5
Taegeuk O-Jang (simplified)	Pa tai, *mirror*.  Po-bo gi-do-po ki-to-bo do.  Fe dul, *mirror*.  Pa-bo gi-ba-po.  Pi gada-votun, *mirror*.  Pa-bo gi-doq!
___  Po-bo gi-do-po ki-to-bo do.  Fe dul, *mirror*.  Pa-bo gi-ba-po.  Pi gada-votun, *mirror*.  Pa-bo gi-doq!	Pa tai, *mirror*.
Pa tai, *mirror*.  ___  Fe dul, *mirror*.  Pa-bo gi-ba-po.  Pi gada-votun, *mirror*.  Pa-bo gi-doq!	Po-bo gi-do-po ki-to-bo do.
Pa tai, *mirror*.  Po-bo gi-do-po ki-to-bo do.  ___  Pa-bo gi-ba-po.  Pi gada-votun, *mirror*.  Pa-bo gi-doq!	Fe dul, *mirror*.
Pa tai, *mirror*.  Po-bo gi-do-po ki-to-bo do.  Fe dul, *mirror*.  ___  Pi gada-votun, *mirror*.  Pa-bo gi-doq!	Pa-bo gi-ba-po.
Pa tai, *mirror*.  Po-bo gi-do-po ki-to-bo do.  Fe dul, *mirror*.  Pa-bo gi-ba-po.  ___  Pa-bo gi-doq!	Pi gada-votun, *mirror*.
Pa tai, *mirror*.  Po-bo gi-do-po ki-to-bo do.  Fe dul, *mirror*.  Pa-bo gi-ba-po.  Pi gada-votun, *mirror*.  ___	Pa-bo gi-doq!

Taegeuk Yuk-Jang
What number is “yuk”?	6
Taegeuk Yuk-Jang (simplified)	Pa gi-pe, *mirror*.  Ve ge.  Pe-da gi-ta, *mirror*.  Pun-pahbah fe keq!  Ba ki-be, *mirror*.  Fen ven fo-da vo-ta.
___  Ve ge.  Pe-da gi-ta, *mirror*.  Pun-pahbah fe keq!  Ba ki-be, *mirror*.  Fen ven fo-da vo-ta.	Pa gi-pe, *mirror*.
