Pa gi-pe, *mirror*.  Ve ge.  Pe-da gi-ta, *mirror*.  Pun-pahbah fe keq!  ___  Fen ven fo-da vo-ta.	Ba ki-be, *mirror*.
Pa gi-pe, *mirror*.  Ve ge.  Pe-da gi-ta, *mirror*.  Pun-pahbah fe keq!  Ba ki-be, *mirror*.  ___	Fen ven fo-da vo-ta.

Taegeuk Chil-Jang
What number is “chil”?	7
Taegeuk Chil-Jang (simplified)	Vo gi-po, *mirror*.  Fan van.  Vol-dol, *mirror*.  Zauhn peba-pabe bopa-bape.  Pel tyungu-den-pul, *mirror*.  To gon-dun do kon-tun fe daq!
___  Fan van.  Vol-dol, *mirror*.  Zauhn peba-pabe bopa-bape.  Pel tyungu-den-pul, *mirror*.  To gon-dun do kon-tun fe daq!	Vo gi-po, *mirror*.
