Taegeuk Pal-Jang
What number is “pal”?	8
Taegeuk Pal-Jang (simplified)	Pen da gi-kiq-po-da-ta da!  Pabye tyuhdeh, *mirror*.  Fen da gi-vo.  Fen ki-da fo, *mirror*.  Ban ki-giq-bo-ta-da!  Fe du-do-ta, *mirror*.
